<title>USA: Gottschalks July same-store sales up 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Gottschalks July same-store sales up 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gottschalks Inc said July 1997 sales were $28.4 million, up 5.5 percent from $26.9 millionin July 1996, and same store sales for the four weeks ended August 2, 1997 were also up 5.5 percent from the year- earlier period.</p>
<p>On a year-to-date basis, total sales increased 5.1 percent to $190.5 million from $181.2 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Same store sales on a year-to-date basis were 5.0 percent higher than the prior year, it said.</p>
</text>
